    "detailed_description": "<strong>Overview</strong><br>Experience the freedom of a classic RPG within a cutting-edge, free-to-play, open-world, multiplayer online experience. Explore, fight, collect, build, and conquer alongside your friends, and against your enemies, without any pay-to-win elements, all while immersing yourself in the story of Eurone.<br><br><strong>Explore the vast world of Eurone</strong><br>On foot, mounted, through magic, or... flying! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/9f76291418161ad6b5f426964a060c53.poster.avif?t=1722030287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/9f76291418161ad6b5f426964a060c53.webm?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/9f76291418161ad6b5f426964a060c53.mp4?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Create your own class</strong><br>Train and evolve in what pleases you! Combine various skills to make your hero unique!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/5887e2c1c48c3557469696dca939b0a4.poster.avif?t=1722030287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/5887e2c1c48c3557469696dca939b0a4.webm?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/5887e2c1c48c3557469696dca939b0a4.mp4?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Fight monsters</strong><br>For those who choose to explore the world of Eurone, be prepared to battle or tame the wild and fantastical creatures that inhabit these lands.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/a617bf197117637658e51646d6fc8826.poster.avif?t=1722030287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/a617bf197117637658e51646d6fc8826.webm?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/a617bf197117637658e51646d6fc8826.mp4?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Harvest resources</strong><br>Mining, Skinning, Lumberjack, Herbalist, Inscription, Tamer, and much more... it's all up to you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/6f2faa4066ba9c0cb7bd3d6da651733a.poster.avif?t=1722030287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/6f2faa4066ba9c0cb7bd3d6da651733a.webm?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/6f2faa4066ba9c0cb7bd3d6da651733a.mp4?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Find treasures</strong><br>Long-forgotten relics and artifacts can be found in the most hidden, mysterious... and dangerous locations of Eurone.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/0a18c49e29566f178cf52f979478de97.avif?t=1722030287\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Overview</strong><br>Experience the freedom of a classic RPG within a cutting-edge, free-to-play, open-world, multiplayer online experience. Explore, fight, collect, build, and conquer alongside your friends, and against your enemies, without any pay-to-win elements, all while immersing yourself in the story of Eurone.<br><br><strong>Explore the vast world of Eurone</strong><br>On foot, mounted, through magic, or... flying! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/9f76291418161ad6b5f426964a060c53.poster.avif?t=1722030287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/9f76291418161ad6b5f426964a060c53.webm?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/9f76291418161ad6b5f426964a060c53.mp4?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Create your own class</strong><br>Train and evolve in what pleases you! Combine various skills to make your hero unique!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/5887e2c1c48c3557469696dca939b0a4.poster.avif?t=1722030287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/5887e2c1c48c3557469696dca939b0a4.webm?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/5887e2c1c48c3557469696dca939b0a4.mp4?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Fight monsters</strong><br>For those who choose to explore the world of Eurone, be prepared to battle or tame the wild and fantastical creatures that inhabit these lands.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/a617bf197117637658e51646d6fc8826.poster.avif?t=1722030287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/a617bf197117637658e51646d6fc8826.webm?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/a617bf197117637658e51646d6fc8826.mp4?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Harvest resources</strong><br>Mining, Skinning, Lumberjack, Herbalist, Inscription, Tamer, and much more... it's all up to you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/6f2faa4066ba9c0cb7bd3d6da651733a.poster.avif?t=1722030287\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/6f2faa4066ba9c0cb7bd3d6da651733a.webm?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/6f2faa4066ba9c0cb7bd3d6da651733a.mp4?t=1722030287\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Find treasures</strong><br>Long-forgotten relics and artifacts can be found in the most hidden, mysterious... and dangerous locations of Eurone.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356810/extras/0a18c49e29566f178cf52f979478de97.avif?t=1722030287\" /></span>",
